<p>Sear your hatred into the mind of a target, dealing escalating Mind damage each turn over 5 turns. The victim will suffer <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">19, 26, 31, 35, 39</acronym> damage on the first turn, slowly increasing up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">96, 129, 155, 177, 196</acronym> damage on the last, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">287, 387, 464, 530, 588</acronym> Mind damage in total. Re-applying the effect resets the damage escalation. The victim has a 25% chance of suffering Brainlock each turn from the unbearable pain.</p><p></p><p>The damage increases with your Mindpower.</p>